            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>v2025.01.0 releases a collection of small changes and pins scipy to &lt;1.15 while we finalize removing the deprecating sph_harm in favor of sph_harm_y.

&lt;!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main --&gt;

What's Changed

Bug Fixes



